   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Farmland Landscapes</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Farm Plot Size and Landscape Beauty\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication of the landscape rating task in Janeckova Molnarova et al. (2023), International Journal of Environmental Research and Public Health 20(1):687, with the authors' own photomontages. Participants rate how beautiful two Czech farmland views look when the same fields are split into plots of about 50, 35, 20, 10 or 5 hectares.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"plots\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"landscapes\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I have read the information above and agree to take part.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"Yes\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"No\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"imageslidergroup\",\n      \"name\": \"ratings\",\n      \"title\": \"Landscape beauty ratings\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"imageCount\": 1,\n      \"scaleMin\": 1,\n      \"scaleMax\": 7,\n      \"description\": \"One row per image (key = landscape_A1 … landscape_A5, landscape_D1 … landscape_D5). Landscape A = flat terrain with almost no woody vegetation (lowest baseline heterogeneity), landscape D = distinctive relief with dense woody vegetation (highest). The number is the plot-size step made in Photoshop by the authors: 1 ≈ 50 ha plots, 2 ≈ 35 ha, 3 ≈ 20 ha, 4 ≈ 10 ha, 5 ≈ 5 ha. All 10 images in one random order; 1 = very ugly … 7 = very beautiful. Analysis in the paper: compare mean ratings across plot sizes within each landscape, and by respondent group (age, education, occupation, size of municipality).\",\n      \"dimensions\": [\n       {\n        \"id\": \"beauty\",\n        \"label\": \"How beautiful do you find this landscape?\",\n        \"left\": \"very ugly\",\n        \"right\": \"very beautiful\",\n        \"min\": 1,\n        \"max\": 7,\n        \"step\": 1\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"What is your gender?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"age_group\",\n      \"title\": \"How old are you?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"18–35 years\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"36–52 years\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"53–69 years\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 4,\n        \"text\": \"70 years and over\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"education\",\n      \"title\": \"What is the highest level of education you have completed?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Elementary\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"High school\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"University\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"birth_size\",\n      \"title\": \"How large is the municipality where you were born?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"The paper asked for the municipality of birth and coded it into these five size categories (and into 14 Czech regions, which are left out here).\",\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Up to 1,000 inhabitants\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"1,001–10,000\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"10,001–100,000\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 4,\n        \"text\": \"100,001–1,000,000\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 5,\n        \"text\": \"Over 1,000,000\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"residence_size\",\n      \"title\": \"How large is the municipality where you live now?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Up to 1,000 inhabitants\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"1,001–10,000\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"10,001–100,000\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 4,\n        \"text\": \"100,001–1,000,000\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 5,\n        \"text\": \"Over 1,000,000\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"occupation\",\n      \"title\": \"Which best describes your occupation or field of study?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Landscape design or conservation (architecture, landscape and urban planning, ecology, nature conservation)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Production in the landscape (agriculture, forestry)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"Not directly connected to landscape planning, use or conservation\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#eef0f2;--card:#fff;--ink:#1b1e22;--muted:#5a616b;--accent:#2f5d62;--accent-ink:#fff;--line:#d5d9de;--warn:#b3261e}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.4rem;margin:0 0 10px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}\n.q{margin-top:18px}.q>b{display:block;margin-bottom:4px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:9px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\ninput[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:120px}\n.pic{background:#2a2d31;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;aspect-ratio:588/313;max-height:min(58vh,560px)}\n.pic img{max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}\n.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px}\n.t{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.bar{height:5px;background:var(--line);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;flex:1;margin-left:12px;max-width:260px}.bar>i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}\n.qq{font-weight:600;margin:12px 0 6px}\n.sc{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:5px}\n.sc button{appearance:none;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);border-radius:9px;padding:11px 0;font:inherit;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\n.sc button.on{background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.ends{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px;gap:12px}.ends span:last-child{text-align:right}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Photographs and photomontages: Janeckova Molnarova et al. (2023), IJERPH 20(1):687, doi:10.3390/ijerph20010687 (CC BY 4.0). Used with credit for research; removed if the authors object.</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='farmplots2023:';\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, M={}, D=null, ans={}, done={}, order=[];\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function load(k){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY+k));}catch(e){return null;}}\n  function save(k,v){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY+k,JSON.stringify(v));}catch(e){}}\n  function saveAll(l,b,cb){Promise.all(l.map(function(a){return a[2]?SPSite.answer(a[0],a[1],a[2]):SPSite.answer(a[0],a[1]);})).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}cb();});}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)),t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function stem(n){return n.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'');}\n  function list(){return M.plots||[];}\n  function byName(n){var l=list();for(var i=0;i<l.length;i++)if(l[i].name===n)return l[i];}\n  function next(){\n    window.scrollTo(0,0);\n    if(!ans.intro)return intro();\n    if(!ans.howto)return howto();\n    for(var i=0;i<order.length;i++){if(!done[stem(order[i])])return trial(i);}\n    if(!ans.about)return about();\n    finish();\n  }\n  function page(title,html,btn,cb){\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"card\">'+(title?'<h1>'+esc(title)+'</h1>':'')+html+'<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+esc(btn||'Continue')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=cb;\n  }\n  function radios(name){return (Q[name].choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+name+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('');}\n  function val(n){var x=app.querySelector('input[name='+n+']:checked');return x?Number(x.value):null;}\n  function intro(){\n    if(!list().length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Pictures missing</h1><p>Media folder plots must hold the ten landscape images.</p>';return;}\n    page('How beautiful are these farmland landscapes?','<p>In this study you will see '+list().length+' photographs of agricultural landscapes, one at a time, and rate how beautiful each one looks to you. It takes about 5 minutes.</p><p>There are no right or wrong answers; we are interested in your personal impression.</p><p>Participation is voluntary and anonymous. You must be 18 or older.</p><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label>','Start',function(){\n      if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll([['consent',true]],b,function(){ans.intro=true;next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function howto(){\n    page('Instructions','<p style=\"color:var(--ink)\">For each photograph, rate the landscape on a scale from <b>1 = very ugly</b> to <b>7 = very beautiful</b>.</p><p style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Some pictures may look alike. Please judge each one on its own. Tap a number and the next picture appears straight away.</p>','Begin',function(){ans.howto=true;next();});\n  }\n  function trial(i){\n    var f=byName(order[i]), n=0;order.forEach(function(x){if(done[stem(x)])n++;});\n    var b='';for(var v=D.min;v<=D.max;v++)b+='<button type=\"button\" data-v=\"'+v+'\">'+v+'</button>';\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"top\"><span class=\"t\">Image '+(n+1)+' of '+order.length+'</span><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:'+(100*n/order.length)+'%\"></i></div></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"Photograph of an agricultural landscape\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"qq\">'+esc(D.label)+'</div><div class=\"sc\">'+b+'</div><div class=\"ends\"><span>1 = '+esc(D.left)+'</span><span>7 = '+esc(D.right)+'</span></div><div class=\"err\"></div>';\n    var busy=false;\n    app.querySelectorAll('.sc button').forEach(function(x){x.onclick=function(){\n      if(busy)return;busy=true;x.classList.add('on');var k=stem(f.name);\n      SPSite.answer('ratings',{beauty:Number(x.dataset.v)},{key:k,shown:[f.name]}).then(function(r){\n        if(!ok(r)){busy=false;x.classList.remove('on');return err(r.error);}\n        done[k]=true;setTimeout(next,150);});\n    };});\n  }\n  var ABOUT=['gender','age_group','education','birth_size','residence_size','occupation'];\n  function about(){\n    page('About you',ABOUT.map(function(n){return '<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(Q[n].title)+'</b>'+radios(n)+'</div>';}).join(''),'Finish',function(){\n      var l=[];for(var i=0;i<ABOUT.length;i++){var v=val(ABOUT[i]);if(!v)return err('Please answer: '+Q[ABOUT[i]].title);l.push([ABOUT[i],v]);}\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll(l,b,function(){ans.about=true;next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p>Some of the pictures showed the same two landscapes with the fields digitally split into plots of about 50, 35, 20, 10 or 5 hectares. In the original survey of 1,033 Czech adults, smaller plots made the flat landscape with almost no trees look more beautiful, and the more varied landscapes with woods and hedgerows were rated more beautiful overall.</p><p style=\"font-size:.82rem\">Photographs and task: Janeckova Molnarova, K., Bohnet, I. C., Svobodova, K., Černý Pixová, K., Daniels, M., Skaloš, J., Drhlíková, K., Azadi, H., Zámečník, R., &amp; Sklenička, P. (2023). Does increasing farm plot size influence the visual quality of everyday agricultural landscapes? IJERPH 20(1):687, doi:10.3390/ijerph20010687. Used with credit and removed if the authors object.</p><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');var m=r.missing||[];setTimeout(function(){m.forEach(function(x){\n      if(x==='consent')ans.intro=false;else if(x==='ratings')done={};else ans.about=false;});next();},1800);}\n      else{var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers have been saved. You can close this window now.';}});\n  }\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent'].concat(ABOUT).forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{};});\n    var R=SPSite.getQuestion('ratings')||{};D=(R.dimensions||[])[0]||{label:'How beautiful do you find this landscape?',left:'very ugly',right:'very beautiful',min:1,max:7};\n    M.plots=(SPSite.getMedia('plots')||[]).slice();\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    var names=list().map(function(f){return f.name;});var o=load('order');\n    if(!o||o.length!==names.length||o.some(function(x){return names.indexOf(x)<0;}))o=shuffle(names);order=o;save('order',order);\n    ((a.ratings&&a.ratings.trials)||[]).forEach(function(t){if(t.key)done[t.key]=true;});\n    if(a.consent===true){ans.intro=true;if(Object.keys(done).length)ans.howto=true;}\n    if(a.occupation!=null)ans.about=true;\n    next();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
